summary['limits']=['Only the exact hashed default-parameter source and actual supplied netlists; alternative parameters are unproved','Defined primary inputs and nominal-power, zero-delay Liberty functional semantics','Common reset low at the first two sampled global steps; equality/definedness holds at steps 2 through 4; later resets are arbitrary','Clock levels are independent and unconstrained, with no fixed ratio or fairness assumption','Yosys clk2fflogic uses its documented negative-hold-time asynchronous-reset convention when reset release coincides with a clock edge','Equivalence preserves the RTL behavior; it is not an independent proof that calibration numerics, analog performance or every intended functional requirement is correct','No source-level arbitrary-X propagation guarantee: standard synthesis normalization uses opt without keepdc','No analog metastability, synchronizer MTBF, SDF timing, recovery/removal, power-integrity/connectivity, extracted-GDS equivalence or LVS conclusion']
